# Klar OS paid product — this repo is PUBLIC on GitHub. The learnings corpus
# and the playbook zip are what the $49 buys; they live in the private Supabase
# `corpus` and `kit` buckets and are served by the token-gated feed and by the
# deliver-playbook edge function. These patterns are a tripwire, not the
# mechanism: nothing here should ever be produced inside this repo.
/corpus/
/public/dl-*.zip
klar-os-playbook-*.zip
/build/learnings/
